dialect protocol
protocol stdio.xlsx.strict.mutations
version 1
schema stdio.xlsx
start record
framing record
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag varint
record set-main-namespace tag=1
field payload bytes
record set-relationships-namespace tag=2
field payload bytes
